1
00:00:00,835 --> 00:00:03,105
(Amy:)So, no one else knows
about this?

2
00:00:03,104 --> 00:00:05,304
(Sheldon:)Only you.

3
00:00:06,908 --> 00:00:09,508
(Amy:)Thank you for trusting me.

4
00:00:09,511 --> 00:00:11,511
(Sheldon:)What good is having
a girlfriend

5
00:00:11,513 --> 00:00:14,243
(Sheldon:)if you can't unload your
psychological sewage on her?

6
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:18,250
(Amy:)That's me,
your emotional outhouse.

7
00:00:19,988 --> 00:00:21,888
(Amy:)You know,

8
00:00:21,890 --> 00:00:25,560
(Amy:)if you ever decide you want
to do something about this,

9
00:00:25,560 --> 00:00:27,230
I'm-I'm here for you.

10
00:00:27,229 --> 00:00:29,499
(Sheldon:)Thank you.

11
00:00:29,497 --> 00:00:31,797
(Sheldon:)I wouldn't even know
how to begin.

12
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,430
(Amy:)Baby steps, I guess.

13
00:00:34,436 --> 00:00:36,906
(Bernadette:)Mm.

14
00:00:43,378 --> 00:00:46,508
(Sheldon:)I suppose I could try
getting rid of the golf ball.

15
00:00:47,315 --> 00:00:49,245
(Amy:)Oh. Okay.

16
00:00:50,252 --> 00:01:01,022
(Sheldon:)I will always have the dent
to remember it by.

